### Variables (ajuste conforme seu ambiente)
@host = http://localhost:8080
@projectId = 1
@entryId = 1
@attachmentId = 1
@responsibleUserId = 1

### JWT
## NÃO COMMITAR TOKENS REAIS no repositório. Cole aqui apenas um token de teste.
@JWT_TOKEN =

### ============================================================
### PRÉ-REQUISITOS – execute na ordem antes de tocar no diário
### ============================================================
###
### 0) Banco de pé:
###      docker compose up -d db
###    (Postgres 17 em localhost:5432, base/usuário/senha = prissma)
###    Suba a aplicação com ./mvnw spring-boot:run — o Flyway aplica a V13
###    e cria construction_diary_entries automaticamente.
###
### 1) LOGIN — sem token nenhuma rota do diário responde (401)
### 2) OBRA  — o diário é sempre de uma obra; sem ela: 404 "Project not found"
### 3) MEMBRO ATIVO — quem escreve precisa de MANAGE_DIARY (OWNER, ENGINEER
###    ou FOREMAN). Quem cria a obra já entra como OWNER, então o passo 3 só
###    é necessário para testar outros papéis.
### 4) ANEXO (opcional) — só se for testar o vínculo com attachment.

### 1. Login (copie o token da resposta para @JWT_TOKEN acima)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@prissma.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 2. Criar a obra (o autor vira OWNER ativo automaticamente)
POST {{host}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "title": "Obra Diario",
  "cep": "80000000",
  "street": "Rua Teste",
  "city": "Curitiba",
  "state": "PR",
  "number": "100",
  "projectType": "RESIDENCIAL",
  "category": "REFORMA",
  "landArea": 100,
  "builtArea": 80,
  "plannedStartDate": "2026-01-10",
  "plannedEndDate": "2026-06-10"
}

### 2.1 Conferir os membros da obra (confirma o OWNER ACTIVE)
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 3. (Opcional) Vincular outro usuário para testar papéis
### FOREMAN escreve no diário; ARCHITECT só lê.
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "userId": 2,
  "roleInProject": "FOREMAN"
}

### 4. (Opcional) Subir um anexo da obra para vincular ao registro
### Use um arquivo real; tipos aceitos: pdf, png, jpeg, gif, bmp, tiff, webp, docx.
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="relatorio.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./relatorio.pdf
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="target"

PROJECT
------Boundary--

### ============================================================
### DIÁRIO DA OBRA – criar, listar e excluir
### ============================================================

### 5. Criar registro (responsável = usuário autenticado quando omitido)
### entryType: OCCURRENCE | DELIVERY | WORKFORCE | IMPEDIMENT
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "entryDate": "2026-08-30T08:00:00Z",
  "entryType": "OCCURRENCE",
  "description": "Inicio da alvenaria do pavimento terreo"
}

### 5.1 Entrega de material
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "entryDate": "2026-08-31T13:30:00Z",
  "entryType": "DELIVERY",
  "description": "Entrega de 200 sacos de cimento"
}

### 5.2 Efetivo do dia
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "entryDate": "2026-09-01T07:15:00Z",
  "entryType": "WORKFORCE",
  "description": "12 profissionais: 6 pedreiros, 4 serventes, 2 eletricistas"
}

### 5.3 Impedimento, com responsável explícito e anexo vinculado
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "entryDate": "2026-09-01T16:45:00Z",
  "entryType": "IMPEDIMENT",
  "description": "Chuva forte interrompeu a concretagem as 16h",
  "responsibleUserId": {{responsibleUserId}},
  "attachmentId": {{attachmentId}}
}

### 6. Listar paginado (mais recente primeiro) — padrão page=0, size=20
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 6.1 Primeira página com 3 itens
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries?page=0&size=3
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 6.2 Segunda página (confirma a continuidade da ordenação)
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries?page=1&size=3
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 7. Excluir registro (pegue o id na listagem acima)
DELETE {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries/{{entryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### ============================================================
### EXEMPLOS DE ERRO / VALIDAÇÃO
### ============================================================

### 400 – data no futuro (o diário registra o que já aconteceu)
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "entryDate": "2030-01-01T10:00:00Z",
  "entryType": "OCCURRENCE",
  "description": "registro no futuro"
}

### 400 – tipo inválido
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "entryDate": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z",
  "entryType": "ATRASO",
  "description": "tipo que nao existe"
}

### 400 – descrição em branco
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "entryDate": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z",
  "entryType": "OCCURRENCE",
  "description": "   "
}

### 400 – responsável que não é membro ativo da obra
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "entryDate": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z",
  "entryType": "OCCURRENCE",
  "description": "responsavel de fora da obra",
  "responsibleUserId": 999
}

### 400 – size acima do teto de 100
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries?size=500
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 404 – anexo de outra obra
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "entryDate": "2026-09-01T10:00:00Z",
  "entryType": "DELIVERY",
  "description": "anexo de outra obra",
  "attachmentId": 99999
}

### 404 – excluir registro pela obra errada (isolamento entre obras)
DELETE {{host}}/projects/99999/diary-entries/{{entryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### 403 – papel sem MANAGE_DIARY (faça login como ARCHITECT e repita o POST)
### 401 – sem o header Authorization
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/diary-entries
